# Work client (`packages/work`)

Independent task UI for `opencode serve`. Do not import from `packages/app`.

## Layout

- Main chat column: full flexible width between rail and workspace (no `max-w-*` on the message column)
- Rail + workspace: resizable with `@opencode-ai/ui/resize-handle`; persist widths in `localStorage`
- Workspace focus/selection must reset when `task` id or directory changes

## Chat & files

- Multi-turn history: render all user/assistant turns, not only the last message
- Markdown: `@opencode-ai/ui/markdown` inside `MarkedProvider`
- Workspace: write/edit/patch/diff files; preview via `client.file.read` with paths relative to session directory
- Auto-scroll chat only when pinned near bottom; never force-scroll on every delta

## Data

- SDK: `@opencode-ai/sdk/v2/client`
- Live updates: `client.global.event()` SSE reducer in `context/store.tsx`
- Dev: backend `:4096`, work Vite `:3001` (`bun run dev:work`)
